'''Zamelle''' (キャベロン, ''Kyaberon'') is a [[:Category:Zombie Enemies|Zombie]] variant of [[Camelle]] that appears in [[Legend Stages]] and [[Cats of the Cosmos]]'s [[Zombie Outbreaks]]. She was added in [[Version 5.8 Update|Version 5.8]].

