==Trivia==
*Her Japanese name, Kyaberon, is a pun on キャメロン ''Kyameron'' (Cameron, as in [[wikipedia:Cameron Diaz|Cameron Diaz]], who also used to be a cover girl), and べろん ''beron'' (an onomatopoeia for sticking one's tongue out).
**When written in Japanese, ''Cameron Diaz'' can also be read as ''Camelon Diaz''.
*Her English description is a reference to how plastic surgery is infamously known for its lethality, especially when done by unscrupulous agencies, primarily due to blood loss, heart failure, or poisoning. On the other hand, her Japanese description only mentions she became a Zombie from a mere side-effect.
*Despite what her Japanese description says, camels do sweat, though they require a much higher temperature than humans and therefore tend not to. When they do, it evaporates directly from their skin rather than their coat, which helps to provide a cooling effect.

